    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d96">

                <pb facs="0165" n="105" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg105"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr.
                            Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-08-14"><hi rendition="#italic">August 14, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received Sept. 26.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2308.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose a translation
                    of a communication from the Tsung-li Yamên, in answer to my communication which
                    I forwarded to you in dispatch No. 2295, of August 3, relating to the Szechuan
                    riots.</p>
                <p>The Yamên makes a weak defense of the local officials.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Denby</hi></signed>.</closer>


                <xi:include href="d96-a1.xml" xpointer="d96-a1"/>
            </div>
